            "text": "<p>On the coast of Southern California, known for its perfect weather, ease of living and natural beauty, two friends with a common obsession for skincare and makeup (and over 20 years of collective experience in the industry) set off to reimagine what their daily routines could look and feel like.</p><p>Lauren as a busy mother, and Marianna with her jet-set schedule, identified a need for beauty that did more without overdoing it.</p><p>Their first product, Jet Lag Mask, embodied efficiency and simplicity.<br/>It was versatile.<br/>It was clean.<br/>It was multi-purpose.<br/>It sold out instantly.</p><p>Today the vision has grown into a carefully curated assortment of powerful-yet-gentle skincare products and hybrid makeup to make routines feel effortless and skin look luminous so every day feels like a summer Friday.</p>"
